{"id":"df87516b55fd3188","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure.md","title":"ZFC Prob Invariant Measure","display":"df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure — ZFC Prob Invariant Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure — ZFC Prob Invariant Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure — ZFC Prob Invariant Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> (sigma-algebra candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (probability-measure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (measurable endomap candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\})=\\mu(A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\})=\\mu(A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Invariance is now guarded by a probability-space structure and measurability of the endomap through measurable preimages.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S$ (probability-space predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbInvariantMeasure}_S(\\mu,T,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:T(x)\\in A\\})=\\mu(A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"15e64b61d7ddb119","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure.md|58-df-zfc-prob-invariant-measure]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d4d304b0bbb11c1a","36d7463d215be751"]}